# Task 155-004 Execution Plan

## Objective
Write a 200+ word Turkish/technical documentation for `deckent_set_directives` MCP tool.

## Key Sources Reviewed
- `src/mcp/tools/directives.ts` — MCP tool registration, inputSchema, response fields
- `src/cli/commands/set-directives.ts` — CLI counterpart, stdin/file/content modes
- `src/orchestra/task-builder.ts` — `parseStructuredDirectives()` function implementation

## Key Facts Gathered
1. Tool writes DIRECTIVES.md file to project root
2. `content` param: Markdown string with `## Task N:` or `## Görev N:` headings
3. Each block supports: Model, Effort, Skills, Files, Scope, Dependencies, Priority, Agent, Provider fields
4. `parseStructuredDirectives()` splits on `## Task N:` regex, extracts per-block metadata
5. Fallback: bullet/numbered list format if no headings found
6. Code blocks in content are masked before scope extraction to prevent false positives
7. Tool returns: taskCount, breakdown (code/docs/test/analysis), estimatedModels (opus/sonnet/haiku)
8. Prerequisite: `deckent_init` must be run first
9. Each call overwrites DIRECTIVES.md (idempotentHint: false)

